    content: 'Knitwear is often associated with winter, but the right pieces can transition beautifully through all four seasons. Here is how to make your LINFAIR knits work year-round.\n\n## Winter Layering\n\nWinter is the natural season for knitwear. Heavyweight turtlenecks and fleece-lined sweaters are perfect for cold days. Layer a chunky cardigan over a thin merino base layer, or wear a cashmere crew neck under a wool coat. Accessorize with scarves and gloves in complementary earth tones.\n\n## Spring Transitions\n\nAs temperatures rise, switch to lighter knits. A short-sleeve cashmere blend sweater pairs perfectly with high-waisted trousers or a midi skirt. Open-front cardigans make excellent layering pieces over floral dresses. Stick to lighter colors like cream, blush, and pastels for a fresh spring look.\n\n## Summer Knits\n\nYes, you can wear knitwear in summer! Choose lightweight, breathable fibers like cashmere blends or fine-gauge cotton knits. Drop shoulder short-sleeve sweaters are ideal for air-conditioned offices or cool summer evenings. Pair with linen pants or denim shorts for a relaxed look.\n\n## Fall Favorites\n\nFall is the time to bring out textured knits. Cable patterns, ribbed turtlenecks, and open-front cardigans in warm autumnal colors \u2014 camel, rust, olive, and burgundy \u2014 capture the season\'s spirit. Layer a mock neck sweater under a blazer for a sophisticated fall outfit.\n\n## Seasonal Color Palette\n\n- **Winter**: Charcoal, navy, burgundy, forest green\n- **Spring**: Cream, blush, light blue, lavender\n- **Summer**: White, sand, pastel pink, sky blue\n- **Fall**: Camel, rust, olive, chocolate brown\n\n## The Versatility of Cashmere Blends\n\nA cashmere blend sweater is one of the most versatile pieces you can own. It is dressy enough for the office yet comfortable enough for weekend errands. The key is choosing classic cuts and neutral colors that transcend seasonal trends.\n\nAt LINFAIR, our collection is designed with versatility in mind. Each piece is crafted to be a wardrobe staple that works across seasons.',
